{2} + 5 x - 2).\n$$\n\nWe can factor the quadratic factor even further, and get\n\n$$\n3 x^{4} - 7 x^{3} - 13 x^{2} + 23 x - 6=(x - 1)(x - 3)\\underbrace{(3 x - 1)(x + 2)}_{P(x)}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=(3 x - 1)(x + 2).$" 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518576 1068 #edb/ref 17592186518560 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518576 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518576 1071 "Find the polynomial $P(x)$ given that\n\n$$\n3 x^{4} - 17 x^{3} + 16 x^{2} + 20 x - 16=(x - 4)(x + 1)P(x).\n$$" 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518576 1072 #uuid "e21b7f4a-96d6-5518-b504-9f9fc1a33098" 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518576 1074 "Let $f(x)=3 x^{4} - 17 x^{3} + 16 x^{2} + 20 x - 16.$ We know that $(x - 4)$ and $(x + 1)$ are factors of $f(x),$ and we need to find its other factors.\n\nBecause $(x - 4)$ is a factor of $f(x),$ we know that $(x - 4)$ divides $f(x)$ with no remainder. So, to begin factoring $f(x),$ we can divide it by $(x - 4)$ using synthetic division:\n\n|  | $x^{4}$ | $x^{3}$ | $x^{2}$ | $x^{1}$ | $x^{0}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $4$ | $3$ | $-17$ | $16$ | $20$ | $-16$ |\n|  | $\\downarrow$ | $12$ | $-20$ | $-16$ | $16$ |\n|  | $3$ | $-5$ | $-4$ | $4$ | $0$ |\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 x^{4} - 17 x^{3} + 16 x^{2} + 20 x - 16}{x - 4}=3 x^{3} - 5 x^{2} - 4 x + 4,\n$$\n\nwhich means that\n\n$$\n3 x^{4} - 17 x^{3} + 16 x^{2} + 20 x - 16=(x - 4)(3 x^{3} - 5 x^{2} - 4 x + 4).\n$$\n\nNow, because $(x + 1)$ is also a factor of $f(x),$ it must be a factor of the quotient $(3 x^{3} - 5 x^{2} - 4 x + 4).$ So, we divide this quotient by $(x + 1)$ using synthetic division once more:\n\n|  | $x^{3}$ | $x^{2}$ | $x^{1}$ | $x^{0}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $-1$ | $3$ | $-5$ | $-4$ | $4$ |\n|  | $\\downarrow$ | $-3$ | $8$ | $-4$ |\n|  | $3$ | $-8$ | $4$ | $0$ |\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 x^{3} - 5 x^{2} - 4 x + 4}{x + 1}=3 x^{2} - 8 x + 4,\n$$\n\nwhich means that\n\n$$\n3 x^{4} - 17 x^{3} + 16 x^{2} + 20 x - 16=(x - 4)(x + 1)(3 x^{2} - 8 x + 4).\n$$\n\nWe can factor the quadratic factor even further, and get\n\n$$\n3 x^{4} - 17 x^{3} + 16 x^{2} + 20 x - 16=(x - 4)(x + 1)\\underbrace{(3 x - 2)(x - 2)}_{P(x)}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=(3 x - 2)(x - 2).$" 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518577 1080 "(x + 2)(x + 4)" 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518577 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518577 1083 #uuid "e5b189d5-4fe1-5252-a78f-94a54754ba0a" 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518578 1080 "(2 x - 2)(x + 2)" 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518578 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518578 1083 #uuid "ea8b82e6-c307-5894-ba37-88a78965716f" 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518579 1080 "(2 - x)(x + 4)" 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518579 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518579 1083 #uuid "eef6d77e-1cb5-5f09-87d0-24953d96ba59" 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518580 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186054803.py" 13194139535573 17592186045443 true] [17592186518580 1169 #uuid "b70e551e-27f6-5ce9-90f7-2bb34ca364d4" 13194139535573 17592186045443 true]] :edb/tempids {"00a93499-f229-5ff0-9ba6-3bde21bfc3d4" 17592186518545 "0419dbc0-1445-5bc9-b917-8b83592d2040" 17592186518546 "118ff845-c36f-5dd4-b4be-4d2f3371534c" 17592186518547 "20c38d13-4072-56a0-9b5d-ac570ea86a6f" 17592186518548 "263727d6-d29d-5bf3-b0ce-64f4c4babbe0" 17592186518549 "2a8f4cd9-343f-53f9-8da8-6987fb92aa94" 17592186518550 "34dd07d8-0fb5-5860-b429-c5d95674c1e6" 17592186518551 "3b5c0465-6f7c-51a9-b3cb-19ece0fb2e97" 17592186518552 "4a850ce8-6c2f-56e9-97a6-d54695d622f9" 17592186518553 "4c1f5d50-c28c-5707-9506-4115f417afd9" 17592186518554 "5f60ea94-d78d-524d-860b-1089e09972ec" 17592186518555 "632410d0-6cb4-56f4-acbe-ce18db1f0810" 17592186518556 "6cc14d2b-da71-5a68-9167-1fb9c